  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Having right click to default to select and open the menu when you do it over people and items can be annoying to deal with in some worlds. The best example I have is my world where I use right click as a secondary fire. This now creates a mess when you accidentally opens the menu when shooting over other players.\n\nI know this behaviour can be turned off in the menu. But I feel like resorting to having the \"Please change this in your menu to play my game\" is kind of bad.\n\nI do see why this was implemented. But It steals one of the big nice buttons we can use for things.",
